 schedule before leaving.","short_summary":"A named independent coffee stop anchoring the compact Norse Way business corridor.","evidence_claim":"Wolf's Brew Coffee lists its address as 4145 Norse Way and publishes operating hours on its official website.","source_url":"https://www.wolfsbrewlb.com/","source_title":"Wolf's Brew Coffee","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official site lists Monday–Friday 8 a.m.–5 p.m. and Saturday–Sunday 8 a.m.–4 p.m.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csulb-little-coyote-los-coyotes-diagonal","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Little Coyote — Los Coyotes","title":"Order Pizza on Los Coyotes Diagonal","subtitle":"Los Coyotes Diagonal in East Long Beach","notes":"Use the Los Coyotes location—not the separate Retro Row shop—when pizza fits an off-campus lunch or early-evening plan.","short_summary":"A clearly identified pizza destination directly on the diagonal corridor northeast of campus.","evidence_claim":"Little Coyote's official site identifies its Los Coyotes location at 3500 N. Los Coyotes Diagonal and publishes weekday hours.","source_url":"https://littlecoyotelbc.com/","source_title":"Little Coyote: Long Beach Pizza Shop & More","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official site lists the Los Coyotes location Monday–Friday, noon–9 p.m.; verify before a weekend trip.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csulb-el-dorado-nature-center-spring-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"El Dorado Nature Center","title":"Follow the Trails off Spring Street","subtitle":"Spring Street at the San Gabriel River","notes":"Enter from Spring Street, cross the wooden bridge, and choose the pa